    "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: original fan-made production sprite sheet for a side-view tactical video game, faithful to Metal Gear Solid V The Phantom Pain (1984). EXACTLY 4 columns by 4 rows, exactly 16 independently DRAWN full-body poses of ONE same character. Pure flat magenta #FF00FF canvas with five thin continuous pure cyan #00FFFF vertical grid lines and five horizontal grid lines, including outer boundaries. Each equal square cell must contain exactly one complete character, wholly inside, generous empty margin at least 30 pixels, no extremity or equipment on guides. Fixed camera, strict orthographic RIGHT-facing profile, feet bottom aligned, identical physical scale every frame. Detailed crisp military pixel art, clear small-scale silhouette, no scenery, no ground shadow, no text, no labels, no logos, no watermark. The sixteen poses must be genuinely different drawings, never simple shifted duplicates. Four phases per row in left-to-right time order, preserve all costume and identity features in EVERY pose. Keep weapons and hands compact inside their cell. Subject: Skull Face from MGSV The Phantom Pain. Faithful to Konami TPP official portrait and licensed Play Arts Kai figure. Lean tall mature man with skull-like severely scarred pale gray facial skin, black domino-style eye mask, distinctive black wide-brimmed felt hat. Black long leather coat, black formal waistcoat over shirt with dark copper patterned necktie, black trousers, black gloves, black boots. Sinister upright refined posture, not a literal skeleton or cowboy sheriff. Row1: four quiet idle breathing stages. Row2: four compact right-facing walking phases: heel contact, weight compression, opposite leg passing, opposite heel contact. Row3: four stages lifting compact black radio to mouth then lowering it. Row4: four subtle defensive recoil and recovery poses, small bend then rise, head always strict RIGHT-facing profile. NO detached marks, no VFX, no floating pixels, no speech cloud, no weapons needed. Every frame same hat and mask and coat, margins remain empty magenta.",
    "references": [
      {
